{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-approval-llm#card-zh","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-approval-llm","commit":"f1f71426913d2739b0fb2c5ed852ca5a828ef67b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-llm 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的权限审批插件：它接入 approval/request 流程，并增加独立模型评审的权限模式。插件先按工具名应用自动放行、直接拒绝或交给人工的规则，再将其余请求交给评审模型；模型返回允许、拒绝或转人工的决定。评审输入可结合会话中的工具参数和工具说明，超时或无法解析时交由后续审批者处理，连续拒绝达到阈值也会转人工。模型的允许或拒绝结果可作为消息追加到会话。适合希望为 DSH 配置模型辅助审批并保留人工接管流程的用户。可通过 DSH 插件 bundle 安装，评审模型可显式配置，也可沿用会话路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:114-183","src/reviewer.ts:164-229","cordis.patch.yml:17-31"]}
{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-approval-llm#card-en","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-approval-llm","commit":"f1f71426913d2739b0fb2c5ed852ca5a828ef67b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-approval-llm adds a model-reviewed mode to DSH approvals. Exact tool-name lists allow, deny, or hand requests to a human; other requests go to a reviewer model. It can use session tool details, hand off on errors or repeated denials, and record decisions in the session.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:114-183","src/reviewer.ts:164-229","cordis.patch.yml:17-31"]}
